<title>USA: NYSE SAYS SEPT SHORT INTEREST SETS ALL-TIME HIGH.</title>
<headline>NYSE SAYS SEPT SHORT INTEREST SETS ALL-TIME HIGH.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said on Thursday that short interest as of September 13, 1996 increased 114.5 million shares to 2,551,054,678 shares.</p>
<p>This was an increase from the August 15, 1996 total of 2,436,552,904 shares.</p>
